<title>TAIWAN: Ever Forture gets T$13.95 bln loans.</title>
<headline>Ever Forture gets T$13.95 bln loans.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's top economic planning agency said on Friday it would grant T$13.95 billion in loans to Ever Fortune Industrial Co to build a gas-fired power station on the island.</p>
</text>
